WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.340 --> 00:00:02.860
With the introduction of our rubbish and organics bins

00:00:02.860 --> 00:00:06.240
there will be a few changes to our kerbside collection service.

00:00:09.380 --> 00:00:14.100
Rubbish, both for bins and Council branded bags will be moving from a weekly

00:00:14.100 --> 00:00:18.140
to a fortnightly collection – this will alternate with your
recycling bin.

00:00:18.140 --> 00:00:20.600
While organics will be collected weekly.

00:00:20.600 --> 00:00:23.800
Some areas will also have changed collection days.

00:00:23.800 --> 00:00:28.380
If you’re unsure about yours or want to sign up for text or email reminders

00:00:28.380 --> 00:00:33.500
visit waimakariri.govt.nz/rethinkrubbish

